9. AMD FIDELITYFX CONTRAST ADAPTIVE SHARPENING
===============================================================================

The CAS sharpen-only algorithm is adapted from FidelityFX SDK 1.1.4,
Copyright (C) 2024 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.

License: MIT-style FidelityFX SDK license. The complete permission and
disclaimer text is in src/desktop/AMD-FidelityFX-CAS-LICENSE.txt, and in
resources/desktop/AMD-FidelityFX-CAS-LICENSE.txt in release packages.

The C++ application constructs the GPU shader from
src/processing/shaders/sharpening_0.glsl.in and sharpening_1.glsl.in.
Transfer handling and parameters are prepared by src/processing/effects.cpp.
This implementation replaces the earlier Python/CPU adaptation and is
used by the image and video Sharpening stage.

